# Implementation Plan - New Auth Flip-Card Design

The goal is to replace the current Apple-inspired login and register forms with a new "flip-card" design inspired by Uiverse.io, which allows switching between login and signup within the same visual component.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> The new design uses a checkbox-based flip mechanism. I will adapt this to React to ensure the state is correctly managed and that the forms function as expected with the existing backend APIs.

