## Verification Plan

### Manual Verification
- Verify that clicking the switch flips the card between Login and Sign up.
- Verify that both forms correctly submit to their respective API endpoints.
- Verify that the design looks "premium" and matches the user's provided snippet.
- Check responsiveness on mobile and desktop.
